      "a_loose_or_tilted_helmet_protects_almo": "A loose or tilted helmet protects almost as poorly as no helmet at all. Concussion-research data shows 60-80% of cyclist head injuries happen with a helmet that was incorrectly fitted or unstrapped at the moment of impact.",
