      "iconic_reef_damselfish_schools_hover_a": "Iconic reef damselfish. Schools hover above corals + descend into the coral for predator refuge. Octopuses regularly hunt them by stalking through coral crevices.",
      "iconic_scene_where_captain_nemo_s_subm": "Iconic scene where Captain Nemo's submarine Nautilus is attacked by a giant squid. Verne's description was based on then-recent giant squid specimens washed up on Newfoundland beaches. The novel both reflected + amplified Victorian fascination with the deep ocean as a mysterious frontier.",
