      "reversing_the_life_cycle_medusae_trans": "Reversing the life cycle: medusae transforming into polyps and cell transdifferentiation in Turritopsis nutricula",
      "review_of_evidence_of_sentience_in_cep": "Review of evidence of sentience in cephalopod molluscs and decapod crustaceans",
