      "most_accessible_activity_for_nearly_an": "Most accessible activity for nearly any body.",
      "most_people_s_relationship_with_food_h": "Most people's relationship with food has bumps. There's a difference between an OCCASIONAL hard day with food (which is part of being human) and a PATTERN that interferes with your life or your health.",
      "most_people_with_eating_disorders_reco": "Most people with eating disorders recover, especially when they get support EARLIER rather than later. Recovery isn't linear — it has hard days, setbacks, and slow improvement — but the trajectory is real and well-documented.",
      "most_us_teens_get_only_half_this_fiber": "Most US teens get only ~half this. Fiber feeds gut microbes.",
