      "180_copies_of_a_1_282_page_latin_bible": "~180 copies of a 1,282-page Latin Bible. Subject: the Vulgate. ~49 copies survive (12 on vellum). The punch-matrix-cast workflow that scaled into a continent-wide industry within 50 years.",
