      "torso_held_against_the_drain_by_suctio": "Torso held against the drain by suction. The most lethal type — adult-strength forces.",
      "touch_supervision_within_arm_s_reach_f": "Touch supervision (within arm's reach) for any child who cannot self-rescue. No phones, no looking away, no relying on other children to \"watch.\"",
